99508	99576	99487	99501	a middle - aged English gentleman , who was a kinsman of the St. Georges	3640	“ In my time travelling was undertaken on a very different system to what it is now . The English youth then travelled to frequent , what Lord Bacon says are ‘ especially to be seen and observed , the Courts of Princes . ’ You all travel now , it appears , to look at mountains and catch cold in spouting trash on lakes by moonlight . ”
