103746	103796	103744	103744	Vivian	396	“ in the last instance , I think that death can scarcely be considered an evil . How infinitely is such a destiny to be preferred to that long apprenticeship of sorrow , at the end of which we are generally as unwilling to die as at the commencement ! ”
103797	103801	103803	103804	Miss Fane	822	“ And yet , ”
103806	103818	103803	103804	Miss Fane	822	“ there is something fearful in the idea of sudden death . ”
